title: Undo and redo across several edits; after save, an edit and its undo the file is clean and quitting asks nothing
folders: plain
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-log: saved .*util\.rs
expect-file: plain/src/util.rs :: (?-i)\A//ABD\npub fn double\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n    n \* 2\n\}\n\npub fn triple
expect-file: plain/src/util.rs :: (?-i)n \* 3\n\}\n\z

wait 3000
edit src/util.rs 1 1
key enter
key up
type //
type A
type B
type C
key undo
key undo
key redo
type D
key redo
wait 300
mark before-save
wait 400
key save
wait 600
type  after the save
key enter
type more
wait 300
mark edited-after-save
wait 400
key undo
key undo
key undo
wait 400
mark clean-again
wait 500
quit
